# The body–society architecture (owner, chat 1 T66), as a world in the language.
# TV screen = what is shown; circuits = brain network; cables = veins; router = amygdala with gates;
# server = heart (its frequency reaches others); grid = power; bones = institutions; muscle = people;
# spine = the leader; meta-eye = sees, gathers, feeds back through all channels.
LANGUAGE RSOS 0.2
WORLD body_society
HOST organism KIND human CHANNELS visual, auditory, kinesthetic
HOST society KIND organisation
OBJECT screen KIND display IN organism
OBJECT circuits KIND brain_network IN organism
OBJECT cables KIND veins IN organism
OBJECT router KIND amygdala IN organism
PART router.gates KIND gate
OBJECT server KIND heart IN organism
OBJECT grid KIND power IN organism
OBJECT bones KIND institutions IN society
OBJECT muscle KIND people IN society
OBJECT spine KIND leader IN society
OBJECT meta_eye KIND observer
SCENE body ORDER grid, server, cables, router, circuits, screen
RELATION server pumps cables
RELATION router gates circuits
RELATION circuits drives screen
RELATION muscle holds bones
RELATION spine leads muscle
USE HOST organism
CONSENT organism FOR practice
BASELINE organism
BASELINE society
FLOW server DIRECTION horizontal TO cables       # the pulse moves through the blood
FLOW server DIRECTION outward                     # its frequency is felt by others
LINE information THROUGH server, cables, router.gates, circuits, screen
HEAL router.gates BY meta_eye                     # the gates reopen: courage and white glow (T71)
FLOW meta_eye DIRECTION vertical                  # sees and feeds back through all channels
OBJECT rocket KIND engine
TRANSPLANT rocket TO server AS rocket_heart       # chat 1 T95/T102: the rocket heart
